# Fast CLI ops

Prefer **`rg`** / **`fd`** / **`ast-grep`** over `findstr`, `grep -r`, or `Get-ChildItem -Recurse`.

| Tool | Replaces | Install |
|------|----------|---------|
| `rg` | recursive grep, findstr | `winget install BurntSushi.ripgrep` · `brew install ripgrep` |
| `fd` | find / recursive dir | `winget install sharkdp.fd` · `brew install fd` |
| `ast-grep` | fragile regex refactors | `winget install ast-grep.ast-grep` · `brew install ast-grep` |

Skill: `fast-ops`. See [`docs/research/references.md`](../docs/research/references.md).

**Do not** use MCP for local file search when these CLIs suffice.
